ic. A refit from the hold burns out instead of a hull.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"relic":1,"payMod":1}},{"l":"Move on","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"merc","t":"A mercenary captain","b":"A scarred destroyer captain hails you. Her crew has been paid off and she wants a new cause, for a price.","o":[{"l":"Hire her (80 credits)","s":"A destroyer of your own kind, with a veteran captain, joins the fleet.","r":{"cost":80,"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"k":"oath","l":"Offer her a place in the line, no pay","s":"She takes the oath. A destroyer of your own kind joins with a veteran captain.","need":{"fac":"voidsworn"},"r":{"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"l":"Decline","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"storm","t":"Warp storm","b":"A storm front rolls across your jump route, lightning the colour of old blood.","o":[{"l":"Punch straight through","s":"Every ship takes 10% hull damage.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fb999999999999a"}},{"k":"shields","l":"Angle every shield into the front","s":"No damage, and your captains learn from it: +10 experience each.","need":{"shields":1},"r":{"xp":10}},{"l":"Chart a way around (40 credits)","s":"Burn fuel and time instead.","r":{"cost":40}}]},{"id":"seer","not":["ithar"],"t":"An Ithar seer","b":"A lone Ithar vessel matches your course. Its seer offers a trade: one of your refits for one of their treasures.","o":[{"l":"Trade a module for a relic","s":"Lose a random installed module. Gain a relic.","r":{"loseMod":1,"relic":1}},{"k":"song","l":"Sing back to her","s":"She trades a relic for a song. No refit lost.","need":{"fac":"ithar"},"r":{"relic":1}},{"l":"Refuse politely","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"wright","t":"The rogue shipwright","b":"A hermit shipwright on an asteroid forge offers to rework one of your hulls. He asks only for the stories of your battles.","o":[{"l":"Let him work","s":"Your most damaged ship is fully repaired and upgraded one Mark.","r":{"upgradeOne":1}},{"k":"pay","l":"Pay him in refits too (one from the hold)","s":"Your most damaged ship is repaired and upgraded, and a second ship is fully repaired.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"upgradeOne":1,"repairOne":1,"payMod":1}},{"l":"Move on","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"moon","not":["chorus"],"t":"The infested moon","b":"Chorus spores have taken a mining moon. Survivors are signalling from the deep shafts, but a brood is gestating.","o":[{"l":"Purge the moon","s":"Fight an elite Chorus battle. Win a relic.","r":{"fight":"chorus"}},{"k":"flak","l":"Sweep the shafts with point defense","s":"Rescue the survivors before the brood hatches: +60 credits, +15 experience for every captain.","need":{"kind":"flak"},"r":{"cred":60,"xp":15},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"l":"Bombard from orbit and leave","s":"+20 captain experience for every captain.","r":{"xp":20}}]},{"id":"shrine","not":["chorus","deathless"],"t":"A void-shrine","b":"An orbital shrine to a forgotten saint hangs over a dead world. Your crews ask to make an offering.","v":{"hegemony":{"b":"An old orbital shrine hangs over a dead world. Spacers are a superstitious lot, and your crews ask to leave an offering."},"corsair":{"b":"An orbital shrine to some forgotten saint hangs over a dead world. Even pirates hedge their bets: your crews ask to leave an offering."},"ithar":{"t":"A shrine of the old world","b":"A shrine from before your people’s fall hangs over a dead world. Your crews ask to leave an offering."}},"o":[{"l":"Offer 50 credits","s":"Every ship repairs 30% hull.","r":{"cost":50,"healAll":"#d:3fd3333333333333"}},{"l":"Pray and hope","s":"Even odds: repair 30%, or nothing.","r":{"gamble":true}},{"k":"relic","l":"Leave one of your relics as an offering","s":"Every ship is fully repaired and every captain gains 20 experience.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"healAll":1,"xp":20}},{"l":"Leave","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"deserters","not":["hegemony"],"t":"Hegemony deserters","b":"A lifeboat of Hegemony officers begs for asylum. They know how the Navy fights.","o":[{"l":"Take them in","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 60 experience.","r":{"xpLow":60}},{"k":"question","l":"Question them about the enemy commander","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 30 experience and a Nemesis weakness is revealed.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpLow":30,"nemIntel":1}},{"l":"Hand them back for the bounty","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"cache","not":["corsair"],"t":"Smuggler cache","b":"A corsair cache hidden in the rings of a gas giant. The locks are primitive.","o":[{"l":"Crack it open","s":"Gain a random module.","r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"both","l":"Crack it with a torpedo, then strip the fuel","s":"A refit and the credits.","need":{"kind":"torp"},"r":{"mod":1,"cred":45}},{"l":"Take the fuel and credits","s":"+45 credits.","r":{"cred":45}}]},{"id":"tithe","t":"The tithe vault","b":"An abandoned tithe station turns slowly in the dark, its vault still sealed. The alarm circuits look old, but alive.","o":[{"k":"crack","l":"Blow the vault","s":"+70 credits. The alarm will reach someone: the Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"lance","l":"Cut the vault open with a lance","s":"+70 credits, quietly.","need":{"kind":"lance"},"r":{"cred":70},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it sealed","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"pilot","t":"A stranded pilot","b":"A lone life pod drifts across your course. Inside, a fighter pilot clutches the logbook of a wing that no longer exists.","o":[{"k":"take","l":"Take her aboard","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 40 experience from her stories.","r":{"xpLow":40},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"wing","l":"Give her a wing on your carrier","s":"Your best carrier’s wings gain a veteran perk.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"wingPerk":1},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave her to the rescue buoys","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"reactor","t":"A cracked reactor","b":"Engineers report a hairline crack in a reactor housing. It will hold for a battle, perhaps two.","o":[{"k":"vent","l":"Vent and patch it","s":"Your largest ship takes 20% hull damage.","r":{"dmgBig":"#d:3fc999999999999a"}},{"k":"refit","l":"Rebuild it around a spare refit","s":"A refit from the hold is used up. No damage.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"payMod":1}},{"k":"metal","l":"Let the living metal knit it","s":"No cost.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{}},{"k":"pay","l":"Buy parts from a passing hauler (45 credits)","s":"No damage.","r":{"cost":45}}]},{"id":"squall","t":"Ion squall","b":"A wall of ion static rolls toward the fleet. It will scour paint, sensors and anything not shielded.","o":[{"k":"ride","l":"Ride it out","s":"Every ship takes 8% hull damage.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fb47ae147ae147b"}},{"k":"shield","l":"Bring the shields up and push through","s":"No damage; captains learn from it: +10 experience each.","need":{"shields":1},"r":{"xp":10}},{"k":"round","l":"Go around (35 credits of fuel)","s":"No damage.","r":{"cost":35}}]},{"id":"broker","t":"An information broker","b":"A soft-spoken broker hails you from a cloaked yacht. She claims to know the enemy commander who has been shadowing your fleet.","o":[{"k":"buy","l":"Buy what she knows (60 credits)","s":"A Nemesis weakness is revealed.","r":{"cost":60,"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"debt","l":"Remind her of an old debt","s":"She pays it in secrets: a Nemesis weakness, free.","need":{"fac":"corsair"},"r":{"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Send her away","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"bait","t":"A distress call that sounds wrong","b":"A freighter screams for help on every band. Your signals officer thinks the voice is a recording.","o":[{"k":"loud","l":"Go in loud and take the cargo","s":"+80 credits, but your next fight starts as an ambush.","r":{"cred":80,"ambush":true},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"sweep","l":"Sweep it with point defense first","s":"You find the mines and take the cargo: +80 credits.","need":{"kind":"flak"},"r":{"cred":80},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"ignore","l":"Ignore it","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"spawn","t":"A spawning field","b":"Thousands of translucent egg-sacs drift between two moons, pulsing in time with something far away.","o":[{"k":"burn","l":"Burn them","s":"+20 experience for every captain.","r":{"xp":20},"fl":{"purge":1}},{"k":"harvest","l":"Harvest the membranes","s":"Gain a damage control refit.","r":{"modId":"damcon"}},{"k":"feed","l":"Let the fleet feed","s":"Every ship regrows 30% of its hull.","need":{"fac":"chorus"},"r":{"healAll":"#d:3fd3333333333333"},"fl":{"fed":1}}]},{"id":"lament","t":"A song in the dark","b":"A dying Ithar songship is singing its own lament. The melody carries old star charts in it, for those who can hear.","o":[{"k":"listen","l":"Listen","s":"Every captain gains 15 experience.","r":{"xp":15}},{"k":"join","l":"Join the song","s":"Gain a relic, and the charts show you the enemy commander’s routes: Nemesis clock back one.","need":{"fac":"ithar"},"r":{"relic":1,"nemClock":-1}},{"k":"archive","l":"Trade a relic for its archive","s":"Lose a relic. Reveal a Nemesis weakness and gain 120 credits.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"nemIntel":1,"cred":120},"fl":{"intel":1}}]},{"id":"tomb","not":["deathless"],"t":"A sealed tomb-world","b":"A planet of black glass hums under your keels. Deep below, something counts the seconds until it wakes.","o":[{"k":"wake","l":"Wake it and take what it guards","s":"Fight an elite Deathless battle. Win a relic.","r":{"fight":"deathless"},"fl":{"loud":1}},{"k":"map","l":"Map it from orbit and leave","s":"+30 credits for the charts.","r":{"cred":30}}]},{"id":"tombhome","not":["hegemony","voidsworn","corsair","chorus","ithar"],"t":"A sleeping tomb-world","b":"A tomb-world of your own dynasty, its legions dormant. A word from you would wake one of them.","o":[{"k":"wake","l":"Wake one scythe","s":"A Deathless scythe joins the fleet at full hull.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{"shipRaw":"d_scythe"}},{"k":"tithe","l":"Take its tithe instead","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"mutiny","t":"Mutters below decks","b":"The crew of one of your ships has gone quiet in the wrong way. Their captain asks for orders.","o":[{"k":"pay","l":"Pay a bonus (50 credits)","s":"The mood lifts.","r":{"cost":50}},{"k":"discipline","l":"Make an example","s":"Your flagship captain loses 20 experience; the fleet falls in line.","r":{"payXp":20}},{"k":"talk","l":"Send your most senior captain to talk","s":"Free, and that captain gains 15 experience.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpTop":15},"fl":{"mercy":1}}]},{"id":"convoy","t":"A merchant convoy","b":"A slow convoy of ore haulers asks for safe passage through the next system.","o":[{"k":"escort","l":"Escort them","s":"+45 credits from the grateful masters.","r":{"cred":45},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"trade","l":"Trade with them (60 credits)","s":"Gain a random refit.","r":{"cost":60,"mod":1}},{"k":"shake","l":"Shake them down","s":"+100 credits. Word spreads: the Nemesis clock moves on.","need":{"fac":"corsair"},"r":{"cred":100,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}}]},{"id":"battlefield","t":"The old battlefield","b":"Hulls from a war nobody remembers drift in a slow ring, still bristling with unexploded ordnance.","o":[{"k":"salvage","l":"Salvage carefully","s":"Gain a random refit. One ship takes 12% hull damage from old mines.","r":{"mod":1,"dmgOne":"#d:3fbeb851eb851eb8"}},{"k":"wings","l":"Send the wings in first","s":"They find the mines: a random refit, no damage.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it to the dead","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"scout","t":"A scout in your wake","b":"Long-range scans show a small, fast ship holding exactly at the edge of your sensor range. It carries the enemy commander’s colours.","o":[{"k":"hunt","l":"Turn and hunt it down","s":"Every ship takes 5% hull damage in the chase. Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fa999999999999a","nemC