m a dead crusade. The bidding is slow and the buyers are armed.","o":[{"k":"bid","l":"Bid 120 credits","s":"Gain a relic.","r":{"cost":120,"relic":1}},{"k":"swap","l":"Trade one of your relics for one of theirs","s":"Lose a relic, gain a different one and 40 credits.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"relic":1,"cred":40}},{"k":"leave","l":"Watch and leave","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"saboteur","t":"A saboteur aboard","b":"Small failures keep happening on one of your ships. Someone aboard is working for the enemy commander.","o":[{"k":"search","l":"Search the ship","s":"A firefight: that ship takes 10% hull damage. A weakness is revealed from his notes.","r":{"dmgOne":"#d:3fb999999999999a","nemIntel":1}},{"k":"face","l":"You know his face","s":"The defector you questioned named him. Caught quietly: Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed.","need":{"flag":"defector"},"r":{"nemClock":-1,"nemIntel":1}},{"k":"ignore","l":"Ignore it","s":"The Nemesis clock moves on twice.","r":{"nemClock":2}}]},{"id":"veterans","t":"A retired admiral","b":"An old admiral in a ruined hab offers to teach your captains everything she learned, for a price.","o":[{"k":"pay","l":"Pay her (50 credits)","s":"Every captain gains 25 experience.","r":{"cost":50,"xp":25}},{"k":"oath","l":"Swear her old oath","s":"She teaches for free: every captain gains 25 experience.","need":{"fac":"voidsworn"},"r":{"xp":25}},{"k":"leave","l":"Thank her and leave","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"haven","t":"A pirate haven","b":"A rock riddled with docking tunnels and gun ports. Half the sector’s stolen goods pass through here.","o":[{"k":"raid","l":"Raid it","s":"Fight an elite Corsair battle. Win a relic.","r":{"fight":"corsair"},"fl":{"loud":1}},{"k":"tribute","l":"Pay them to hide your trail (40 credits)","s":"Nemesis clock back one.","r":{"cost":40,"nemClock":-1}},{"k":"recruit","l":"Recruit a crew there","s":"A Corsair raider joins with a veteran captain.","need":{"fac":"corsair