here."}},"o":[{"l":"Go after it","s":"Gain salvage. A random ship takes heavy damage.","r":{"relic":1,"dmgOne":"#d:3fd3333333333333"}},{"k":"shield","l":"Shield the route with a spare refit","s":"Gain salvage. A refit from the hold burns out instead of a hull.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"relic":1,"payMod":1}},{"l":"Move on","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"merc","t":"A mercenary captain","b":"A scarred destroyer captain hails you. Her crew has been paid off and she wants a new cause, for a price.","o":[{"l":"Hire her (80 credits)","s":"A destroyer of your own kind, with a veteran captain, joins the fleet.","r":{"cost":80,"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"k":"oath","l":"Offer her a place in the line, no pay","s":"She takes the oath. A destroyer of your own kind joins with a veteran captain.","need":{"fac":"voidsworn"},"r":{"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"l":"Decline","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"storm","t":"Rift storm","b":"A storm front rolls across your jump route, lightning the colour of old blood.","o":[{"l":"Punch straight through","s":"Every ship takes 10% hull damage.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fb999999999999a"}},{"k":"shields","l":"Angle every shield into the front","s":"No damage, and your captains learn from it: +10 experience each.","need":{"shields":1},"r":{"xp":10}},{"l":"Chart a way around (40 credits)","s":"Burn fuel and time instead.","r":{"cost":40}}]},{"id":"seer","not":["ithar"],"t":"A Glasswright wanderer","b":"A lone Glasswright vessel matches your course. Its keeper offers a trade: one of your refits for one of their treasures.","o":[{"l":"Trade a module for salvage","s":"Lose a random installed module. Gain salvage.","r":{"loseMod":1,"relic":1}},{"k":"song","l":"Answer her tone in glass","s":"She trades salvage for the courtesy. No refit lost.","need":{"fac":"ithar"},"r":{"relic":1}},{"l":"Refuse politely","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"wright","t":"The rogue shipwright","b":"A hermit shipwright on an asteroid forge offers to rework one o