y repaired and every captain gains 20 experience.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"healAll":1,"xp":20}},{"l":"Leave","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"deserters","not":["hegemony"],"t":"Hegemony deserters","b":"An escape pod of Hegemony officers begs for asylum. They know how the Navy fights.","o":[{"l":"Take them in","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 60 experience.","r":{"xpLow":60}},{"k":"question","l":"Question them about the enemy commander","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 30 experience and a Nemesis weakness is revealed.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpLow":30,"nemIntel":1}},{"l":"Hand them back for the bounty","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"cache","not":["corsair"],"t":"Smuggler cache","b":"A Hullbreaker cache hidden in the rings of a gas giant. The locks are primitive.","o":[{"l":"Crack it open","s":"Gain a random module.","r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"both","l":"Crack it with a torpedo, then strip the fuel","s":"A refit and the credits.","need":{"kind":"torp"},"r":{"mod":1,"cred":45}},{"l":"Take the fuel and credits","s":"+45 credits.","r":{"cred":45}}]},{"id":"tithe","t":"The toll vault","b":"An abandoned toll station turns slowly in the dark, its vault still sealed. The alarm circuits look old, but alive.","o":[{"k":"crack","l":"Blow the vault","s":"+70 credits. The alarm will reach someone: the Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"lance","l":"Cut the vault open with a lance","s":"+70 credits, quietly.","need":{"kind":"lance"},"r":{"cred":70},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it sealed","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"pilot","t":"A stranded pilot","b":"A lone life pod drifts across your course. Inside, a fighter pilot clutches the logbook of a wing that no longer exists.","o":[{"k":"take","l":"Take her aboard","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 40 experience from her stories.","r":{"xpLow":40},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"wing","l":"Give her a wing on your carr