:{"cred":30}}]},{"id":"tombhome","not":["hegemony","voidsworn","corsair","chorus","ithar"],"t":"A dormant hull yard","b":"An Eclipse yard from before the collapse drifts in the dark, its hulls stored without minds. A copy from the Archive would wake one of them.","o":[{"k":"wake","l":"Wake one mote","s":"An Eclipse mote joins the fleet at full hull.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{"shipRaw":"d_scythe"}},{"k":"tithe","l":"Strip it for parts instead","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"mutiny","t":"Mutters below decks","b":"The crew of one of your ships has gone quiet in the wrong way. Their captain asks for orders.","o":[{"k":"pay","l":"Pay a bonus (50 credits)","s":"The mood lifts.","r":{"cost":50}},{"k":"discipline","l":"Make an example","s":"Your flagship captain loses 20 experience; the fleet falls in line.","r":{"payXp":20}},{"k":"talk","l":"Send your most senior captain to talk","s":"Free, and that captain gains 15 experience.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpTop":15},"fl":{"mercy":1}}]},{"id":"convoy","t":"A merchant convoy","b":"A slow convoy of ore haulers asks for safe passage through the next system.","o":[{"k":"escort","l":"Escort them","s":"+45 credits from the grateful masters.","r":{"cred":45},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"trade","l":"Trade with them (60 credits)","s":"Gain a random refit.","r":{"cost":60,"mod":1}},{"k":"shake","l":"Shake them down","s":"+100 credits. Word spreads: the Nemesis clock moves on.","need":{"fac":"corsair"},"r":{"cred":100,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}}]},{"id":"battlefield","t":"The old battlefield","b":"Hulls from a war nobody remembers drift in a slow ring, still bristling with unexploded ordnance.","o":[{"k":"salvage","l":"Salvage carefully","s":"Gain a random refit. One ship takes 12% hull damage from old mines.","r":{"mod":1,"dmgOne":"#d:3fbeb851eb851eb8"}},{"k":"wings","l":"Send the wings in first","s":"They find the mines: a random refit, no damage.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it to the dead","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"scout","t":"A scout in your wake","b":"Long-range scans show a small, fast ship holding exactly at the edge of your sensor range. It carries the enemy commander’s colours.","o":[{"k":"hunt","l":"Turn and hunt it down","s":"Every ship takes 5% hull damage in the chase. Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fa999999999999a","nemClock":-1,"nemIntel":1}},{"k":"torp","l":"Torpedo it from range","s":"Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed. No damage.","need":{"kind":"torp"},"r":{"nemClock":-1,"nemIntel":1}},{"k":"ignore","l":"Let it watch","s":"The Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"nemClock":1}}]},{"id":"defector","t":"A defector","b":"An officer from the enemy commander’s own fleet surrenders his shuttle to you. He wants asylum and he wants revenge.","o":[{"k":"question","l":"Interrogate him","s":"A Nemesis weakness is revealed.","r":{"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"ransom","l":"Sell him back","s":"+70 credits. The Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"enlist","l":"Give him a commission","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 50 experience and a weakness is revealed.","need":{"fac":"hegemony"},"r":{"xpLow":50,"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}}]},{"id":"dock","t":"A drifting drydock","b":"An automated drydock still runs on its last power cells. Its arms twitch as your fleet comes alongside.","o":[{"k":"use","l":"Use it (30 credits)","s":"Your most damaged ship is fully repaired.","r":{"cost":30,"repairOne":1}},{"k":"frame","l":"Buy its last frame (100 credits)","s":"Your most damaged ship is repaired and upgraded one Mark.","need":{"cred":100},"r":{"cost":100,"upgradeOne":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it running","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"well","t":"A gravity slingshot","b":"A dead star bends the route ahead. A tight slingshot would save fuel, if the hulls can take the stress.","o":[{"k":"sling","l":"Take the slingshot","s"